    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying but i really think it was just a weird spike in blood pressure or something from caffeine. going to the hospital seems so extreme since the symptoms are 100% gone. can't i just take an aspirin and keep an eye on it for the next 24 hours? if it happens again i'll go, but i'd rather just monitor it for now and see if it stays away.",
